Hi all,

Thanks for pointing out this bug. As a temporary workaround, you should be
able to get AmeliaView to work properly by installing Amelia with the
following command:

install.packages("Amelia", type = "source", repos = "http://r.iq.harvard.edu
")

Then attempt to load AmeliaView in the usual way (either via the desktop
link or the R command line).

Hope that helps!

Cheers,
matt.

